  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance to Mitigate Food Insecurity for Cyclone Affected Vulnerable Households</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal of this project is to provide multi-purpose cash assistance to vulnerable people to be affected by cyclones in the coastal districts of Bangladesh. This WFP project provides unconditional cash assistance and early warning messages to 225,000 people of whom 67,500 are women, 63,000 are men, and 94,500 are children. 2,754 people with disabilities are also targeted under this project.</narrative>
  </description>
